# lib/ and prebuilt/ are intentionally NOT ignored: the built JS and the
# darwin-arm64 PTY binary are committed so a github: install needs no build
# step at all (no `prepare` script, no allowBuilds, no Rust toolchain).
# Sourcemaps are dev-only, so those alone stay ignored.
lib/*.map
lib/**/*.map
